        <body>
            <div xml:id="d594-a4-a16">

                <pb facs="0579" n="505" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg505"/>

                <head>No. 12.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Lisbon</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-18">February
                        18</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Horatio Perry, American Legation, Madrid:</hi></p>
                <p>Has Stonewall been allowed to repair at Ferrol, as alleged in Spanish papers?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HARVEY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
